  allowed transitive: libc v0.2.190 <- getrandom v0.4.3 <- uuid v1.28.0 <- relayable-model (RNG syscall glue; no model API, transport, serialization, or async surface)
  OK: no other relayable-* crate; only the documented libc via uuid's RNG is allowed
